node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log

# This repository is public and `git add -A` is how its first commit was made.
# The four submodules keep their own env files behind their own .gitignore, and
# the parent stores each as a commit SHA rather than a tree — so nothing leaks
# through them. This line is for anything that lands at the root.
.env*

CLAUDE.local.md

# Planning documents, whatever they get called. gitignore has no case-insensitive
# match, so the classes spell it out: AI_PLAN.md, plan.md, R1-Plan.md all land here.
# Scoped to markdown deliberately — an unscoped `*[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn]*` would also
# swallow source files, and `starter/src/workspace/install-plan.ts` is one.
*[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn]*.md
